cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite the paper below."
title: "Measured, Not Assumed: A Field Study of Exam-Time Connectivity and Fault Tolerance in an Under-Connected Indonesian School"
abstract: >-
  De-identified network telemetry and analysis/simulation code from a real online
  mathematics-certification exam at a junior-secondary school in eastern
  Indonesia (157 exam sessions), used to characterise exam-time connectivity and
  to evaluate how much fault tolerance the platform's submission design needs.
type: dataset
authors:
